{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873610/extras/02c30dcefa28d6539078ef65db0d9002.poster.avif?t=1761306672\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873610/extras/02c30dcefa28d6539078ef65db0d9002.webm?t=1761306672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873610/extras/02c30dcefa28d6539078ef65db0d9002.mp4?t=1761306672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Solve puzzles using insect-like traversal skills through imaginary realm, in which there is no up or down.</strong><br><br>Guide mysterious creature in dream world, manipulate the architecture to solve puzzles and find hope instruments. After you wake up, use them to heal the world and escape the never-ending cycle!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873610/extras/47722920cf0f4f3ace2d57ce048c7136.avif?t=1761306672\" width=616 height=90 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique type of puzzles</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>main character has no special abilities beside insect-like movement, instead \u2013 properties of the space are used to create challenges.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls are simple</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>yet complex puzzles are possible.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Non-linear game progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find more than one exit in a level to unlock multiple next levels.<br></li><li>Play or replay any unlocked level in any order.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable hope instruments</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Any intruments and songs you find are not only means of progress in the game, they can be played in the real world.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adaptive soundtrack</h2><ul cla